25,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"It seems our past successes are tied to accessibility, though some older blocks hide nasty surprises.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"The demand for general space is overwhelming, while our specialist rooms sit empty. The disruption costs are also significant.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
27,2,1,talk,George,,"Our grounds staff are depleted, yet the technicians are burdened with manual tasks the equipment should handle.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
28,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,Weather and project rationale are causing massive delays. Comfort-based projects are particularly prone to slipping.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
29,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Costs for mechanical plant are rising sharply, and we have a worrying lack of reserves for audiovisual replacements.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
30,2,2,talk,Toshio,,This suggests we should avoid projects that only benefit a single wing.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,2,talk,Victoria,,Exactly. We need something that maximizes general utility without causing an off-site rental crisis.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,2,talk,George,,"If we can automate the technicians' routines, it would relieve a lot of pressure.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"We must be careful with outdoor work or ""comfort"" upgrades, as they rarely finish on time.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"And we must account for the actual market price of mechanical systems, not just the estimates.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
