50,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"The candidates are A, B, C, and D. Given the reviews, B or D seem most promising for general use.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,3,1,talk,Victoria,,"B addresses the general room shortage directly. D is specialist, which my data suggests is less needed.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,3,1,talk,George,,"A would solve the technicians' manual routine issues, though it is a mechanical project.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,"C is outdoor work, which is a recipe for delays. A and B are safer, though A is mechanical.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A's costs will be high. B is a conversion, likely more stable and budget-friendly.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"I lean toward B. It serves the widest group and avoids the ""single wing"" failure.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,2,talk,Victoria,,I strongly support B. The booking data makes it the only logical choice.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,2,talk,George,,"I still see a strong case for A to help the staff, but B is a strong contender.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,2,talk,Mizuki,,"I'll go with B. It avoids the weather risks of C and the delivery slips of ""comfort"" projects.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,B is the most fiscally responsible choice given the current tender trends for plant equipment.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,3,talk,Toshio,,It seems we have a consensus.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,3,talk,Victoria,,Indeed.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,3,talk,George,,I can concede to the majority.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,3,talk,Mizuki,,Agreed.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,A very rational conclusion.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
